        },
        "valueString": "No fevers, night sweats, or weight loss. No recent trauma recalled. No bowel or bladder change or saddle anaesthesia. Only mild occasional low back ache. No abdominal, urinary, or gastrointestinal symptoms."
      }
    },
    {
